# Three tasks in one group: one checks 5, one checks -3 (and fails), one rests
# for ten seconds. The failure cancels the resting task, so `join` returns at
# once with the error. Prints the rejected value, then exits 3 if the group
# stopped early (4 if it waited out the rest, 0 if nothing failed).

groups is module
groups purpose "Deliver the first failure of a task group and stop its other tasks"
groups path groups
groups imports standard.console
groups imports standard.compare
groups imports standard.math
groups imports standard.clock
groups imports standard.time
groups exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout none

clockReader is capability
clockReader purpose "Authority to read the monotonic clock to measure the group"
clockReader grants read clock.monotonic none

CheckError is enum
CheckError purpose "Why a number was rejected, carrying the number"
CheckError typeParameter none
CheckError variant negative Int64

checkPositive is operation
checkPositive purpose "Accept a number that is zero or more"
checkPositive invariant none
checkPositive typeParameter none
checkPositive input n Int64 copied
checkPositive output none
checkPositive outputOwnedBy none
checkPositive raises CheckError
checkPositive effect none
checkPositive uses none
checkPositive memoryHeap false
checkPositive async false
checkPositive maxRecursion none
checkPositive label begin loopKind none
checkPositive label begin within none
checkPositive label reject loopKind none
checkPositive label reject within none
checkPositive label accept loopKind none
checkPositive label accept within none
checkPositive let zero Int64 0 immutable
checkPositive at begin do isNegative
checkPositive at begin branch if negative goto reject else goto accept
checkPositive at reject do makeError
checkPositive at reject return error rejected
checkPositive at accept return ok none

isNegative is call
isNegative in checkPositive
isNegative invokes compare.lessThanInt64
isNegative argument left Int64 n copy
isNegative argument right Int64 zero copy
isNegative result negative Bool
isNegative ownedBy none
isNegative cleanedBy none
isNegative borrows none
isNegative catch none

makeError is call
makeError in checkPositive
makeError invokes CheckError.negative
makeError argument payload Int64 n copy
makeError result rejected CheckError
makeError ownedBy none
makeError cleanedBy none
makeError borrows none
makeError catch none

rest is operation
rest purpose "Wait ten seconds, or less if cancelled"
rest invariant none
rest typeParameter none
rest input none
rest output none
rest outputOwnedBy none
rest raises none
rest effect none
rest uses none
rest memoryHeap false
rest async true
rest maxRecursion none
rest label begin loopKind none
rest label begin within none
rest let tenSeconds Int64 10000 immutable
rest at begin start sleep into none
rest at begin join sleep
rest at begin return ok none

sleep is task
sleep in rest
sleep invokes time.sleep
sleep argument milliseconds Int64 tenSeconds copy
sleep result none
sleep ownedBy none
sleep cleanedBy none
sleep borrows none
sleep catch none

main is operation
main purpose "Run the three checks as one group and report how it ended"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect write console.stdout
main effect read clock.monotonic
main uses stdoutWriter
main uses clockReader
main memoryHeap false
main async true
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label failed loopKind none
main label failed within none
main label report loopKind none
main label report within none
main label printed loopKind none
main label printed within none
main label early loopKind none
main label early within none
main label late loopKind none
main label late within none
main label allPassed loopKind none
main label allPassed within none
main let five Int64 5 immutable
main let minusThree Int64 -3 immutable
main let fiveSeconds Int64 5000 immutable
main let earlyCode ExitCode 3 immutable
main let lateCode ExitCode 4 immutable
main let passedCode ExitCode 0 immutable
main at begin do clockBefore
main at begin awaitSlot checks
main at begin start checkFive into checks
main at begin awaitSlot checks
main at begin start checkMinus into checks
main at begin awaitSlot checks
main at begin start restLong into checks
main at begin join checks
main at begin branch ifError checks goto failed else goto allPassed
main at failed match checkError CheckError
main at failed case CheckError.negative bind value Int64 goto report
main at report do printValue
main at report branch ifError printValue goto printed else goto printed
main at printed do clockAfter
main at printed do elapsed
main at printed do stoppedEarly
main at printed branch if isEarly goto early else goto late
main at early return ok earlyCode
main at late return ok lateCode
main at allPassed return ok passedCode

checks is taskGroup
checks in main
checks maxTasks 3
checks catch checkError CheckError

clockBefore is call
clockBefore in main
clockBefore invokes clock.monotonic
clockBefore argument none
clockBefore result before Int64
clockBefore ownedBy none
clockBefore cleanedBy none
clockBefore borrows none
clockBefore catch none

checkFive is task
checkFive in main
checkFive invokes checkPositive
checkFive argument n Int64 five copy
checkFive result none
checkFive ownedBy none
checkFive cleanedBy none
checkFive borrows none
checkFive catch fiveError CheckError

checkMinus is task
checkMinus in main
checkMinus invokes checkPositive
checkMinus argument n Int64 minusThree copy
checkMinus result none
checkMinus ownedBy none
checkMinus cleanedBy none
checkMinus borrows none
checkMinus catch minusError CheckError

restLong is task
restLong in main
restLong invokes rest
restLong argument none
restLong result none
restLong ownedBy none
restLong cleanedBy none
restLong borrows none
restLong catch none

printValue is call
printValue rationale "The exit code reports how the group ended even when the value cannot be printed"
printValue in main
printValue invokes console.writeIntegerLine
printValue argument value Int64 value copy
printValue result none
printValue ownedBy none
printValue cleanedBy none
printValue borrows none
printValue catch printError console.WriteError

clockAfter is call
clockAfter in main
clockAfter invokes clock.monotonic
clockAfter argument none
clockAfter result after Int64
clockAfter ownedBy none
clockAfter cleanedBy none
clockAfter borrows none
clockAfter catch none

elapsed is call
elapsed in main
elapsed invokes math.subtractInt64
elapsed argument left Int64 after copy
elapsed argument right Int64 before copy
elapsed result took Int64
elapsed ownedBy none
elapsed cleanedBy none
elapsed borrows none
elapsed catch none

stoppedEarly is call
stoppedEarly in main
stoppedEarly invokes compare.lessThanInt64
stoppedEarly argument left Int64 took copy
stoppedEarly argument right Int64 fiveSeconds copy
stoppedEarly result isEarly Bool
stoppedEarly ownedBy none
stoppedEarly cleanedBy none
stoppedEarly borrows none
stoppedEarly catch none
